allery@napiorkowska.pl","phone_contact":"+32 495 71 89 88","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001184"},"en":{"name":"Antonio Giancaterino \/ Ishchan Nazarian: Conversations","shortdescr":"Join us for the opening of the exhibition \"Conversations\" featuring works by Iszkhan Nazarian and Antonio Giancaterino. The exhibition opens on September 12, 2024, at 7:00 PM at the Gallery of Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska in Brussels, showcasing Nazarian\u2019s paintings and Giancaterino\u2019s bronze sculptures.\n","longdescr":"Ishchan Nazarian\nAntonio Giancaterino\nConversations\n\nOpening \/ Vernissage:\n12 September 2024 at 7 pm\nRSVP: galeria@napiorkowska.pl\n\nGallery of Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska\nMont des Arts 8\nBrussels\n\nIszkhan Nazarian studied painting in Yerevan and Warsaw. He currently lives and works in the United States.\n\nIn 1979, he received the prestigious award for the International Competition Palme d\u2019Or des Beaux Arts in Monte Carlo.\nNazarian\u2019s works can be found in the collections of the Modern Art Museum in Yerevan, the National Museum in Warsaw, the Polish Museum in Rapperswill, the San Lazzaro Museum in Venice, and the Vatican Museum.\n\nAntonio Giancaterino is a sculptor from the Accademia di Belle Arti in Venice. He works mainly in bronze.\n\nGiancaterino received a special award from the city of Venice.\n\nHis works are at the Bob Wilson Museum Foundation in the United States and at the Querini Stampalia Museum in Venice.\n\nThe exhibition will open on Thursday, September 12, 2024, at 7:00 PM at the Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska Gallery at Mont des Arts 8 in Brussels.","performers":"Antonio Goancaterino (Italy): sculptures\nIshkhan Nazarian (USA): paintings","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","email":"gallery@napiorkowska.pl","phone_contact":"+32 495 71 89 88","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001184"},"it":{"name":"Antonio Giancaterino \/ Ishchan Nazarian: Conversations","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","email":"gallery@napiorkowska.pl","phone_contact":"+32 495 71 89 88","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001184"},"cn":{"name":"Antonio Giancaterino \/ Ishchan Nazarian: Conversations","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","email":"gallery@napiorkowska.pl","phone_contact":"+32 495 71 89 88","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001184"},"fr":{"name":"Antonio Giancaterino \/ Ishchan Nazarian: Conversations","shortdescr":"Rejoignez-nous pour l'ouverture de l'exposition \"Conversations\" pr\u00e9sentant les \u0153uvres d'Iszkhan Nazarian et d'Antonio Giancaterino. L'exposition ouvrira ses portes le 12 septembre 2024 \u00e0 19h00 \u00e0 la Galerie de Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska \u00e0 Bruxelles, mettant en avant les peintures de Nazarian et les sculptures en bronze de Giancaterino.","longdescr":"Ishchan Nazarian a \u00e9tudi\u00e9 la peinture \u00e0 Erevan et \u00e0 Varsovie. Vit et travaille actuellement aux \u00c9tats-Unis.\nEn 1979, il re\u00e7oit un prix prestigieux au Concours International Palme d\u2019Or des Beaux Arts de Monte Carlo.\n\nLes \u0153uvres de Nazarian se trouvent, entre autres, chez Ishkhan. Les \u0153uvres de Nazarian font partie des collections du Mus\u00e9e d\u2019art moderne d\u2019Erevan, du Mus\u00e9e national de Varsovie, du Mus\u00e9e polonais de Rapperswill, du Mus\u00e9e San Lazzaro de Venise et de la collection du Mus\u00e9e du Vatican.\n\nAntonio Giancaterino est un sculpteur de l\u2019Acad\u00e9mie des Beaux-Arts de Venise.Il cr\u00e9e principalement en bronze.\nGiancaterino a re\u00e7u un prix sp\u00e9cial de la ville de Venise. Ses \u0153uvres sont expos\u00e9es \u00e0 la Bob Wilson Museum Foundation aux \u00c9tats-Unis et au Querini Stampalia Museum \u00e0 Venise.\n\nIshchan Nazarian\nAntonio Giancaterino\nConversations\n\nVernissage:  12 septembre 2024 \u00e0 19.00\nRSVP: galeria@napiorkowska.pl\nGalerie de Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska\nMont des Art s8\nBruxelles","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","email":"gallery@napiorkowska.pl","phone_contact":"+32 495 71 89 88","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001184"},"sp":{"name":"Antonio Giancaterino \/ Ishchan Nazarian: Conversations","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","email":"gallery@napiorkowska.pl","phone_contact":"+32 495 71 89 88","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001184"},"nl":{"name":"Antonio Giancaterino \/ Ishchan Nazarian: Conversations","shortdescr":"Kom naar de opening van de tentoonstelling \"Conversations\" met werken van Iszkhan Nazarian en Antonio Giancaterino. De tentoonstelling opent op 12 september 2024 om 19:00 uur in de Galerie van Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska in Brussel, met schilderijen van Nazarian en bronzen sculpturen van Giancaterino.","longdescr":"Iszkhan Nazarian studeerde schilderkunst in Jerevan en Warschau. Hij woont en werkt momenteel in de Verenigde Staten. In 1979 ontving hij een prestigieuze prijs op de Internationale Wedstrijd Palme d\u2019Or des Beaux Arts in Monte Carlo.\n\nDe werken van Nazarian bevinden zich onder andere in het Museum voor Moderne Kunst in Jerevan, het Nationaal Museum in Warschau, het Pools Museum in Rapperswil, het San Lazzaro Museum in Veneti\u00eb en de collectie van het Vaticaanse Museum.\n\nAntonio Giancaterino is een beeldhouwer van de Accademia di Belle Arti in Veneti\u00eb. Hij werkt voornamelijk in brons. Giancaterino ontving een speciale prijs van de stad Veneti\u00eb. Zijn werken zijn te zien in de Bob Wilson Museum Foundation in de Verenigde Staten en in het Querini Stampalia Museum in Veneti\u00eb.\n\nIszkhan Nazarian Antonio Giancaterino Gesprekken\n\nOpening: 12 september 2024 om 19:00 Galerie van Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska Mont des Arts 8 Brussel\nRSVP: galeria@napiorkowska.pl","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","email":"gallery@napiorkowska.pl","phone_contact":"+32 495 71 89 88","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001184"}},"place":{"id":251322,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Galerie Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","phone_contact":"+32 495 71 89 88","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 8","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Galerie Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","phone_contact":"+32 495 71 89 88","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 8","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Galerie Katarzyna Napi\u00f3rkowska","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.napiorkowska.pl","phone_contact":"+32 495 71 89 88","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 8","address_line2":"1000