rl":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009629"},"fr":{"name":"The Dominican Brunch","shortdescr":"Laissez-vous s\u00e9duire par un menu exquis, compos\u00e9 des ingr\u00e9dients les plus raffin\u00e9s et des cr\u00e9ations culinaires les plus d\u00e9licates, \u00e9labor\u00e9es par notre chef talentueux. Immergez-vous dans l'atmosph\u00e8re chaleureuse et accueillante de notre \u00e9tablissement.","longdescr":"Dans une ambiance raffin\u00e9e, le buffet propose du saumon fum\u00e9, une quiche v\u00e9g\u00e9tarienne, des bagels, des patates douces au miel, des \u0153ufs brouill\u00e9s avec des toasts et du guacamole, des langoustines au curry, un assortiment de desserts maison, et bien d'autres classiques revisit\u00e9s.\nLe tout accompagn\u00e9 de musique et de toutes les boissons incluses...","performers":"D\u00e9couvrez chaque mois le \u00ab The Dominicain \u00bb Brunch du dimanche ! Venez profiter de notre brunch luxueux avec votre famille et vos amis, o\u00f9 vous vous sentirez privil\u00e9gi\u00e9s et d\u00e9licatement entour\u00e9s. Rejoignez-nous pour un brunch d\u00e9licieux qui c\u00e9l\u00e8bre la beaut\u00e9 de chaque saison.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be","email":"info@thedominican.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009629"},"sp":{"name":"The Dominican Brunch","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be","email":"info@thedominican.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009629"},"nl":{"name":"The Dominican Brunch","shortdescr":"Laat u verleiden door een exquise menu, samengesteld uit de meest verfijnde ingredi\u00ebnten en de meest delicate culinaire creaties, bereid door onze getalenteerde chef-kok. Dompel uzelf onder in de warme en gastvrije sfeer van ons etablissement.","longdescr":"In een verfijnde ambiance biedt het buffet gerookte zalm, vegetarische quiche, bagels, honingzoete aardappelen, roerei met toast en guacamole, langoustines met curry, een assortiment huisgemaakte desserts en nog veel meer klassiekers in een nieuw jasje.\nDit alles vergezeld van live muziek en inclusief alle drankjes...","performers":"Ontdek elke maand de \"The Dominican\" Zondag Brunch! Kom genieten van onze luxueuze brunch met uw familie en vrienden, waar u zich bevoorrecht en verfijnd omringd zult voelen. Sluit u bij ons aan voor een heerlijke brunch die de schoonheid van elk seizoen viert.\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be","email":"info@thedominican.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009629"}},"place":{"id":50000281,"translations":{"de":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Dominican, first member of Design Hotels\u2122 in Belgium, is a destination for elegance in the centre of Brussels. Situated behind the theatre La Monnaie, off Grand Place, its 150 stylish rooms, 3 multifunctional meeting rooms, private courtyard and animated Lounge Bar combine to ensure indulgent hospitality.\nThe award winning architects of FG Stijl and LENS\u00ba ASS, have created an eclectic mix of design in both the interior and exterior, resulting in an array of new styles and experiences. The rich history of the location was a source of inspiration in the exclusive design of The Dominican, mainly the Dominican Abbey which occupied the site during the 15th century. Home to famous French painter Jacques-Louis David in the 19th century, his spirit is preserved in the original facade of his abode, which is today seamlessly integrated into the new building that houses the hotel.\nRooms\nThe 150 guestrooms and suites \u2013 everyone with an individual look \u2013 are located around a quiet courtyard and have a rich blend of contemporary design and luxurious  textiles, offering quiet comfort in a cloister-like setting.\nFood and Drinks at The Dominican\nThe Grand Lounge is located in the heart of the building adjacent to the inner courtyard. Guests in the Grand Lounge are offered lunch and dinner in an intimate setting. The Grand Lounge exudes design and the harmony of high ceilings, capacious windows, natural lighting, metal work, and an innovative menu transforms it into both a lounge and a bar. In warmer weather dining is available in the inner courtyard.\nThe Lounge Bar is a combination of a traditional caf\u00e9 with a lounge atmosphere. Offering cutting-edge interior design, inventive drinks and an a la carte menu, this bar is designed to attract a style-conscious clientele of hotel guests as well the local in-crowd. The grandiose windows and soaring ceilings offer a surprisingly intimate setting.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"L\u2019h\u00f4tel The Dominican est une destination d\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gance au centre de Bruxelles. Situ\u00e9 derri\u00e8re le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de La Monnaie, en bas de la Grand-Place, notre h\u00f4tel design bruxellois offre d\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gantes chambres non-fumeurs, une cour int\u00e9rieure priv\u00e9e et un Grand Lounge tonique.\nTous ces \u00e9l\u00e9ments se compl\u00e8tent pour offrir une hospitalit\u00e9 informelle. Les architectes prim\u00e9s de FG Stijl ont cr\u00e9\u00e9 un m\u00e9lange \u00e9clectique, tant \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur qu\u2019\u00e0 l\u2019ext\u00e9rieur, ce qui se traduit par une palette de nouveaux styles et exp\u00e9riences.\nL\u2019identit\u00e9 historique de cet emplacement fut aussi la source d\u2019inspiration de l\u2019architecture de l\u2019h\u00f4tel, principalement l\u2019Abbaye Dominicaine qui occupait ce lieu au 15\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Maison du peintre Fran\u00e7ais Jacques-Louis David au 19\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, son esprit et sa cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 sont pr\u00e9serv\u00e9s dans la fa\u00e7ade originelle, aujourd\u2019hui enti\u00e8rement int\u00e9gr\u00e9e au b\u00e2timent principal o\u00f9 se trouve l\u2019h\u00f4tel.\nChambres\nLes 150 chambres et suites \u2013 chacune ayant un design singulier \u2013 se composent d\u2019une riche combinaison de design contemporain et textiles luxueux, offrant un confort in\u00e9gal\u00e9.\nLe concept derri\u00e8re le design de chacune de nos chambres est d\u2019offrir l\u2019opportunit\u00e9 de s\u2019\u00e9chapper de la ville pour se retrouver dans une oasis paisible.\nNos chambres luxurieuses ont une vue de La Monnaie d\u2019un c\u00f4t\u00e9 et de notre apaisant Courtyard de l\u2019autre. La cl\u00e9 pour se relaxer au Dominican est de se sentir chez soi. Toutes nos chambres sont ainsi admirablement d\u00e9cor\u00e9es et \u00e9quip\u00e9es de tous les agr\u00e9ments modernes afin de cr\u00e9er une sensation de chez-soi loin de son domicile. Offrant un d\u00e9cor paisible compos\u00e9 de somptueux mat\u00e9riaux, de couleurs chaudes formant un ensemble \u00e9quilibr\u00e9, nos chambres repr\u00e9sentent un sanctuaire luxueux en plein centre de la ville.\nFood and Drinks at The Dominican\nLes volumineux plafonds, les hautes fen\u00eatres, l\u2019\u00e9clairage naturel et l\u2019ouvrage m\u00e9tallique admirablement cisel\u00e9 font du Grand Lounge un cadre \u00e9l\u00e9gant, id\u00e9al pour un repas romantique ou une r\u00e9union professionnelle. Notre menu cr\u00e9atif et notre vaste carte de boissons r\u00e9pondront \u00e0 tous les go\u00fbts. Par temps chaud, nos invit\u00e9s peuvent profiter d\u2019un d\u00eener \u00ab al fresco \u00bb dans la cour centrale.\nLe Lounge Bar de l\u2019h\u00f4tel The Dominican allie parfaitement l\u2019atmosph\u00e8re traditionnelle d\u2019un caf\u00e9 et le confort douillet d\u2019un salon \u00e9l\u00e9gant. Au Lounge Bar, vous trouverez un design int\u00e9rieur sophistiqu\u00e9, des boissons inventives et un menu \u00e0 la carte.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"The Dominican","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"The Dominican, dat in alles een Brusselse sfeer uitademt, ligt aan de Leopoldstraat, vlak achter de Muntschouwburg. Dit top hotel in Brussel laat haar prachtige maar vooral unieke ligging en de geschiedenis van het gebouw goed tot zijn recht komen en combineert tegelijkertijd uitzonderlijk design met buitengewoon comfort.\nDe openbare ruimten en de kamers zijn zorgvuldig vormgegeven en werden ontworpen door het gerenommeerde Nederlands ontwerpersduo FG Stijl. Colin Finnegan en Gerard Glintmeijer van FG Stijl hebben in 2005 de prestigieuze \u201cPrix Villegiature Paris\u201d gewonnen in de categorie Best Interior Design. De overweldigende galerij van het hotel is een duidelijke verwijzing naar het dominicaanse klooster dat hier in de vijftiende eeuw stond. De bekende Franse schilder Jacques-Louis David heeft op deze plek ook nog een tijdje gewoond en gewerkt. De originele gevel van zijn huis is door het Belgische architectenbureau Lens Ass Architects opgenomen als onderdeel van het nieuwe gebouw.\nDe 150 kamers en suites \u2013 ieder met hun eigen uitstraling \u2013 liggen rondom een rustige binnenplaats. Ze kregen een rijke combinatie van hedendaags design en luxe stoffering die rust en comfort biedt in een kloosterachtige omgeving.\nEten en drinken bij The Dominican\nDe Grand Lounge ligt in het midden van het gebouw naast de binnenplaats. Hier kunnen de gasten lunchen en dineren in een intieme omgeving. De Grand Lounge straalt voor de volle 100% design uit. De harmonie tussen de hoge plafonds, de grote raampartijen, het natuurlijk licht, het metaalwerk en de vernieuwende menukaart maken van de Grand Lounge zowel een lounge als een bar. Bij mooi weer is het ook mogelijk om buiten te dineren.\nDe Lounge bar is een combinatie van een traditioneel caf\u00e9 met een loungesfeer. Met zijn hotspot interieur, creatieve drankjes en \u00e0 la carte menu trekt deze bar een client\u00e8le van stijlbewuste hotelgasten maar ook de plaatselijke jetset. De enorme raampartijen en de hoge plafonds cre\u00ebren een verrassend intieme omgeving.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":[],"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":41024,"location":{"lat":50.8492677,"lon":4.3547615},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-05-24T15:03:55+02:00","published_at":"2023-07-31T09:16:27+02:00","import_origin":"crm","external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":50000281,"translations":{"de":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Dominican, first member of Design Hotels\u2122 in Belgium, is a destination for elegance in the centre of Brussels. Situated behind the theatre La Monnaie, off Grand Place, its 150 stylish rooms, 3 multifunctional meeting rooms, private courtyard and animated Lounge Bar combine to ensure indulgent hospitality.\nThe award winning architects of FG Stijl and LENS\u00ba ASS, have created an eclectic mix of design in both the interior and exterior, resulting in an array of new styles and experiences. The rich history of the location was a source of inspiration in the exclusive design of The Dominican, mainly the Dominican Abbey which occupied the site during the 15th century. Home to famous French painter Jacques-Louis David in the 19th century, his spirit is preserved in the original facade of his abode, which is today seamlessly integrated into the new building that houses the hotel.\nRooms\nThe 150 guestrooms and suites \u2013 everyone with an individual look \u2013 are located around a quiet courtyard and have a rich blend of contemporary design and luxurious  textiles, offering quiet comfort in a cloister-like setting.\nFood and Drinks at The Dominican\nThe Grand Lounge is located in the heart of the building adjacent to the inner courtyard. Guests in the Grand Lounge are offered lunch and dinner in an intimate setting. The Grand Lounge exudes design and the harmony of high ceilings, capacious windows, natural lighting, metal work, and an innovative menu transforms it into both a lounge and a bar. In warmer weather dining is available in the inner courtyard.\nThe Lounge Bar is a combination of a traditional caf\u00e9 with a lounge atmosphere. Offering cutting-edge interior design, inventive drinks and an a la carte menu, this bar is designed to attract a style-conscious clientele of hotel guests as well the local in-crowd. The grandiose windows and soaring ceilings offer a surprisingly intimate setting.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"L\u2019h\u00f4tel The Dominican est une destination d\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gance au centre de Bruxelles. Situ\u00e9 derri\u00e8re le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de La Monnaie, en bas de la Grand-Place, notre h\u00f4tel design bruxellois offre d\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gantes chambres non-fumeurs, une cour int\u00e9rieure priv\u00e9e et un Grand Lounge tonique.\nTous ces \u00e9l\u00e9ments se compl\u00e8tent pour offrir une hospitalit\u00e9 informelle. Les architectes prim\u00e9s de FG Stijl ont cr\u00e9\u00e9 un m\u00e9lange \u00e9clectique, tant \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur qu\u2019\u00e0 l\u2019ext\u00e9rieur, ce qui se traduit par une palette de nouveaux styles et exp\u00e9riences.\nL\u2019identit\u00e9 historique de cet emplacement fut aussi la source d\u2019inspiration de l\u2019architecture de l\u2019h\u00f4tel, principalement l\u2019Abbaye Dominicaine qui occupait ce lieu au 15\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Maison du peintre Fran\u00e7ais Jacques-Louis David au 19\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, son esprit et sa cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 sont pr\u00e9serv\u00e9s dans la fa\u00e7ade originelle, aujourd\u2019hui enti\u00e8rement int\u00e9gr\u00e9e au b\u00e2timent principal o\u00f9 se trouve l\u2019h\u00f4tel.\nChambres\nLes 150 chambres et suites \u2013 chacune ayant un design singulier \u2013 se composent d\u2019une riche combinaison de design contemporain et textiles luxueux, offrant un confort in\u00e9gal\u00e9.\nLe concept derri\u00e8re le design de chacune de nos chambres est d\u2019offrir l\u2019opportunit\u00e9 de s\u2019\u00e9chapper de la ville pour se retrouver dans une oasis paisible.\nNos chambres luxurieuses ont une vue de La Monnaie d\u2019un c\u00f4t\u00e9 et de notre apaisant Courtyard de l\u2019autre. La cl\u00e9 pour se relaxer au Dominican est de se sentir chez soi. Toutes nos chambres sont ainsi admirablement d\u00e9cor\u00e9es et \u00e9quip\u00e9es de tous les agr\u00e9ments modernes afin de cr\u00e9er une sensation de chez-soi loin de son domicile. Offrant un d\u00e9cor paisible compos\u00e9 de somptueux mat\u00e9riaux, de couleurs chaudes formant un ensemble \u00e9quilibr\u00e9, nos chambres repr\u00e9sentent un sanctuaire luxueux en plein centre de la ville.\nFood and Drinks at The Dominican\nLes volumineux plafonds, les hautes fen\u00eatres, l\u2019\u00e9clairage naturel et l\u2019ouvrage m\u00e9tallique admirablement cisel\u00e9 font du Grand Lounge un cadre \u00e9l\u00e9gant, id\u00e9al pour un repas romantique ou une r\u00e9union professionnelle. Notre menu cr\u00e9atif et notre vaste carte de boissons r\u00e9pondront \u00e0 tous les go\u00fbts. Par temps chaud, nos invit\u00e9s peuvent profiter d\u2019un d\u00eener \u00ab al fresco \u00bb dans la cour centrale.\nLe Lounge Bar de l\u2019h\u00f4tel The Dominican allie parfaitement l\u2019atmosph\u00e8re traditionnelle d\u2019un caf\u00e9 et le confort douillet d\u2019un salon \u00e9l\u00e9gant. Au Lounge Bar, vous trouverez un design int\u00e9rieur sophistiqu\u00e9, des boissons inventives et un menu \u00e0 la carte.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"The Dominican","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold ","address_street_number":"9-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.carlton.be","website":"https:\/\/www.thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold , 9-15","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"The Dominican, dat in alles een Brusselse sfeer uitademt, ligt aan de Leopoldstraat, vlak achter de Muntschouwburg. Dit top hotel in Brussel laat haar prachtige maar vooral unieke ligging en de geschiedenis van het gebouw goed tot zijn recht komen en combineert tegelijkertijd uitzonderlijk design met buitengewoon comfort.\nDe openbare ruimten en de kamers zijn zorgvuldig vormgegeven en werden ontworpen door het gerenommeerde Nederlands ontwerpersduo FG Stijl. Colin Finnegan en Gerard Glintmeijer van FG Stijl hebben in 2005 de prestigieuze \u201cPrix Villegiature Paris\u201d gewonnen in de categorie Best Interior Design. De overweldigende galerij van het hotel is een duidelijke verwijzing naar het dominicaanse klooster dat hier in de vijftiende eeuw stond. De bekende Franse schilder Jacques-Louis David heeft op deze plek ook nog een tijdje gewoond en gewerkt. De originele gevel van zijn huis is door het Belgische architectenbureau Lens Ass Architects opgenomen als onderdeel van het nieuwe gebouw.\nDe 150 kamers en suites \u2013 ieder met hun eigen uitstraling \u2013 liggen rondom een rustige binnenplaats. Ze kregen een rijke combinatie van hedendaags design en luxe stoffering die rust en comfort biedt in een kloosterachtige omgeving.\nEten en drinken bij The Dominican\nDe Grand Lounge ligt in het midden van het gebouw naast de binnenplaats. Hier kunnen de gasten lunchen en dineren in een intieme omgeving. De Grand Lounge straalt voor de volle 100% design uit. De harmonie tussen de hoge plafonds, de grote raampartijen, het natuurlijk licht, het metaalwerk en de vernieuwende menukaart maken van de Grand Lounge zowel een lounge als een bar. Bij mooi weer is het ook mogelijk om buiten te dineren.\nDe Lounge bar is een combinatie van een traditioneel caf\u00e9 met een loungesfeer. Met zijn hotspot interieur, creatieve drankjes en \u00e0 la carte menu trekt deze bar een client\u00e8le van stijlbewuste hotelgasten maar ook de plaatselijke jetset. De enorme raampartijen en de hoge plafonds cre\u00ebren een verrassend intieme omgeving.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":41024,"location":{"lat":50.8492677,"lon":4.3547615},"last_updated_at":"2024-05-24T15:03:55+02:00","published_at":"2023-07-31T09:16:27+02:00","is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"import_origin":"crm","external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgi