et lampe bois recup","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001293"},"fr":{"name":"Expo Dementale illustration et couleur et lampe bois recup","shortdescr":"L'art du partage a voir a l'Expo","longdescr":"7 rue du grand hospice, 1000 bruxelles.\n\nL'art \u00e7a se partage, venez partager vos ressentis. \u00c0 d\u00e9couvrir et red\u00e9couvrir et la couleur entrant. Venez d\u00e9couvrir ce vieux b\u00e2timent de jadis \u00e9tait un home h\u00f4pital avec sa belle chapelle \u00e0 explorer.\n\nArt is shared, come and share your feelings. To discover and rediscover and the color entering. Come and discover this old building that used to be a home hospital with its beautiful chapel to explore.\n\nKunst wordt gedeeld, kom en deel je gevoelens. Om te ontdekken en herontdekken en de binnenkomende kleur. Kom en ontdek dit oude gebouw dat ooit een thuisziekenhuis was, met zijn prachtige kapel om te verkennen","performers":"Artiste St.\nAutodidacte","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001293"},"sp":{"name":"Expo Dementale illustration et couleur et lampe bois recup","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001293"},"nl":{"name":"Expo Dementale illustration et couleur et lampe bois recup","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001293"}},"place":{"id":276966,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Grand Hospice ist eine Mischung aus Pop-up-Bar, trendigem Hotspot und urbaner Oase - einer der neuen, Allrounder, die die Stadt noch lebendiger machen. Die G\u00e4rten des ehemaligen Institut Pacheco, ein neoklassizistischer Geb\u00e4udekomplex mit sch\u00f6nen Kolonnaden und einem denkmalgesch\u00fctzten Innengarten, sind zu einem beliebten Treffpunkt und Schauplatz zahlreicher kultureller Aktivit\u00e4ten geworden. Plaudern Sie bei einem Drink, spielen Sie P\u00e9tanque mit Freunden, entspannen Sie beim Yoga oder genie\u00dfen Sie eine kleine Auszeit in dem sch\u00f6nen Garten, wo im Sommer die Blumen bl\u00fchen und im Winter Lampion- und Lichterketten leuchten.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"A mix of the \"pop-up bar and lanterns\" spirit, a trendy bar and an urban oasis, the Grand Hospice is one of those new hybrid places that we really love and that make the city more vibrant. The gardens of the former Pacheco Institute, a neoclassical complex with beautiful colonnades and a listed interior park, have become a meeting point for a wide range of social and cultural activities. Chat while having a drink, play p\u00e9tanque with friends, take a relaxing yoga class or enjoy a healthy break in the countryside, this garden, which is in bloom in the summer and decorated with festive lights in winter, is a must-go!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Entre l\u2019esprit \u00ab guinguette et lampions \u00bb, le bar branch\u00e9 et l\u2019oasis urbaine, le Grand Hospice fait partie de ces nouveaux lieux hybrides que l\u2019on aime tant et qui font bouger la ville. Les jardins de l\u2019ancien Institut Pacheco, ensemble n\u00e9oclassique compos\u00e9 de belles colonnades et d\u2019un parc int\u00e9rieur class\u00e9, sont devenus un point de rencontre o\u00f9 activit\u00e9s sociales et culturelles se multiplient \u00e0 l\u2019envie. Pour papoter autour d\u2019un verre, jouer \u00e0 la p\u00e9tanque entre amis, prendre un cours de yoga \u00ab super chill \u00bb ou profiter d\u2019une pause salutaire au vert, ce jardin fleuri aux beaux jours et par\u00e9 de lumi\u00e8res festives en hiver est un must-go !","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Een sfeervol met lampionnen verlicht buitencaf\u00e9 met een trendy bar in een groene stadsoase? Dat is het Grand Hospice, een van de nieuwe, bruisende hybride plekjes waar we graag vertoeven. De tuinen van het voormalige Pacheco-Instituut, een neoclassicistisch geheel met prachtige zuilengangen en een als erfgoed geklasseerd binnenpark, zijn omgetoverd tot een ontmoetingsplek waar plaats is voor tal van sociale en culturele activiteiten. Of je nu met vrienden wilt bijpraten met een glaasje erbij, petanque wilt spelen, een 'superchill' yogales volgen of gewoon even tot rust wilt komen in het groen: alles kan in deze prachtige bloementuin, die in de winter feestelijk verlicht wordt!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":36966,"location":{"lat":50.85351136,"lon":4.35012167},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-05-30T15:27:30+02:00","published_at":"2021-07-27T16:19:21+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":276966,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Grand Hospice ist eine Mischung aus Pop-up-Bar, trendigem Hotspot und urbaner Oase - einer der neuen, Allrounder, die die Stadt noch lebendiger machen. Die G\u00e4rten des ehemaligen Institut Pacheco, ein neoklassizistischer Geb\u00e4udekomplex mit sch\u00f6nen Kolonnaden und einem denkmalgesch\u00fctzten Innengarten, sind zu einem beliebten Treffpunkt und Schauplatz zahlreicher kultureller Aktivit\u00e4ten geworden. Plaudern Sie bei einem Drink, spielen Sie P\u00e9tanque mit Freunden, entspannen Sie beim Yoga oder genie\u00dfen Sie eine kleine Auszeit in dem sch\u00f6nen Garten, wo im Sommer die Blumen bl\u00fchen und im Winter Lampion- und Lichterketten leuchten.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"A mix of the \"pop-up bar and lanterns\" spirit, a trendy bar and an urban oasis, the Grand Hospice is one of those new hybrid places that we really love and that make the city more vibrant. The gardens of the former Pacheco Institute, a neoclassical complex with beautiful colonnades and a listed interior park, have become a meeting point for a wide range of social and cultural activities. Chat while having a drink, play p\u00e9tanque with friends, take a relaxing yoga class or enjoy a heal