ositions","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[40,36],"translations":{"de":["Grafische K\u00fcnste","Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Graphic art","Museums and art centers"],"it":["Arti grafiche","Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Arts graphiques","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Artes gr\u00e1ficas","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Grafische kunst, vormgeving","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Design du livre & du papier","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/design-du-livre-du-papier\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000103"},"pt":{"name":"Design du livre & du papier","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/design-du-livre-du-papier\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000103"},"en":{"name":"Design du livre & du papier","shortdescr":"To celebrate the summer solstice, Wittockiana is inviting students from the \u2018Book and Paper Design\u2019 workshop at the \u00c9cole nationale sup\u00e9rieure des arts visuels de La Cambre (ENSAV) to present their work: book-objects, artist\u2019s books, minimalist containers or precious bindings, working with leather or creating paper, packaging\u2026 there\u2019s something for everyone. ","longdescr":"To celebrate the summer solstice, Wittockiana is inviting students from the \u2018Book and Paper Design\u2019 workshop at the \u00c9cole nationale sup\u00e9rieure des arts visuels de La Cambre (ENSAV) to present their work: book-objects, artist\u2019s books, minimalist containers or precious bindings, working with leather or creating paper, packaging\u2026 there\u2019s something for everyone. The courses offered at La Cambre approach and explore books and paper in their entirety, as part of a contemporary artistic approach.\nThe exhibition will be an opportunity to discover the wide range of practices and experiments being attempted in all areas (media, formats, layout, typography, editorial writing, etc.). Getting to know, appreciating and\/or questioning the projects produced by these young people is a form of participation in the emergence and affirmation of a contemporary artistic and critical sense. La Wittockiana is proud and happy to welcome these initiatives, which pay tribute to the medium of the book.","performers":"Angeline Guzman, Anna Marguier, AtlanticBarbara, Clo\u00e9 Barbier, Consuelo Gournay, Dina Benayed, Dunya Savilova, Elo\u00efse Agostini , Jeanne Champenois-Masset, Lola Roy-Cassayre, Maude Cottenier, Nora Amaouche, Ninnog Gesland-Bouilly, Roxane Daguet, Sarah Juin, Zo\u00e9 Peray ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/en\/design-du-livre-du-papier-2\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000103"},"it":{"name":"Design du livre & du papier","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/design-du-livre-du-papier\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000103"},"cn":{"name":"Design du livre & du papier","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/design-du-livre-du-papier\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000103"},"fr":{"name":"Design du livre & du papier","shortdescr":"Pour f\u00eater le solstice d\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9, la Wittockiana invite les \u00e9tudiant.e.s de l\u2019Atelier \u00ab Design du livre et du papier \u00bb de l\u2019\u00c9cole nationale sup\u00e9rieure des arts visuels de La Cambre (ENSAV) \u00e0 pr\u00e9senter leurs travaux : livre-objet, livre d\u2019artiste, contenants minimalistes ou reliures pr\u00e9cieuses, travail du cuir ou cr\u00e9ation de papier, packaging\u2026 il y en a pour tous les go\u00fbts. ","longdescr":"Pour f\u00eater le solstice d\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9, la Wittockiana invite les \u00e9tudiant.e.s de l\u2019Atelier \u00ab Design du livre et du papier \u00bb de l\u2019\u00c9cole nationale sup\u00e9rieure des arts visuels de La Cambre (ENSAV) \u00e0 pr\u00e9senter leurs travaux : livre-objet, livre d\u2019artiste, contenants minimalistes ou reliures pr\u00e9cieuses, travail du cuir ou cr\u00e9ation de papier, packaging\u2026 il y en a pour tous les go\u00fbts. En effet, le cursus dispens\u00e9 \u00e0 La Cambre approche et explore le livre et le papier dans leur globalit\u00e9 tout en s\u2019inscrivant dans une d\u00e9marche artistique contemporaine.","performers":"Angeline Guzman, Anna Marguier, AtlanticBarbara, Clo\u00e9 Barbier, Consuelo Gournay, Dina Benayed, Dunya Savilova, Elo\u00efse Agostini , Jeanne Champenois-Masset, Lola Roy-Cassayre, Maude Cottenier, Nora Amaouche, Ninnog Gesland-Bouilly, Roxane Daguet, Sarah Juin, Zo\u00e9 Peray ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/design-du-livre-du-papier\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000103"},"sp":{"name":"Design du livre & du papier","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/design-du-livre-du-papier\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000103"},"nl":{"name":"Design du livre & du papier","shortdescr":"Om de zomerzonnewende te vieren toont de Wittockiana de werken van de studenten van het atelier \u2018Book and Paper Design\u2019 van de \u00c9cole nationale sup\u00e9rieure des arts visuels de La Cambre (ENSAV): boekobjecten, kunstenaarsboeken, minimalistische verpakkingen of kostbare banden, werken met leder of papiercreaties, packaging\u2026 er is voor elk wat wils. ","longdescr":"Om de zomerzonnewende te vieren toont de Wittockiana de werken van de studenten van het atelier \u2018Book and Paper Design\u2019 van de \u00c9cole nationale sup\u00e9rieure des arts visuels de La Cambre (ENSAV): boekobjecten, kunstenaarsboeken, minimalistische verpakkingen of kostbare banden, werken met leder of papiercreaties, packaging\u2026 er is voor elk wat wils. De cursussen van La Cambre verkennen boek en papier in hun geheel, als onderdeel van een hedendaagse artistieke benadering.","performers":"Angeline Guzman, Anna Marguier, AtlanticBarbara, Clo\u00e9 Barbier, Consuelo Gournay, Dina Benayed, Dunya Savilova, Elo\u00efse Agostini , Jeanne Champenois-Masset, Lola Roy-Cassayre, Maude Cottenier, Nora Amaouche, Ninnog Gesland-Bouilly, Roxane Daguet, Sarah Juin, Zo\u00e9 Peray ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/wittockiana.org\/nl\/design-du-livre-du-papier-3\/","email":"info@wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000103"}},"place":{"id":142,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Wittockiana: Msueum f\u00fcr Buch- und Buchbindekunst","address_street_name":"Rue du Bemel","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@wittockiana.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Rue du Bemel, 23"