ine Vanden Neste & Tom Lyon - SAS \/ Gilbard","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/instagram.com\/gilbard.e.s","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012981"},"en":{"name":"Pauline Vanden Neste & Tom Lyon - SAS \/ Gilbard","shortdescr":"From 6 September to 18 October, Gilbard welcomes Pauline Vanden Neste and Tom Lyon to the SAS for \u2018Zones\u2019. Working on the canal zone since 2020, the Belgian photographic duo have created a portrait that questions its reappropriation and the issues involved in sharing public space.","longdescr":"From 6 September to 18 October, Gilbard welcomes Pauline Vanden Neste and Tom Lyon to the SAS for \u2018Zones\u2019. Working on the canal zone since 2020, the Belgian photographic duo have created a portrait that questions its reappropriation and the issues involved in sharing public space. To mark the occasion, they are putting on an exhibition that takes the SAS as its central point, with the route taking in the adjacent streets. \n\nThe exhibition is open free of charge and without booking on Fridays from 1.30pm to 6pm, during Gilbard's opening hours. \nIt is also open by appointment during the rest of the week. Would you like to organize a guided tour for a group? Contact us at prog@gilbard.be\nOpening on Friday 06\/09\/2024, from 3pm to 7pm, in the presence of the artists. \n\n","performers":"Pauline Vanden Neste & Tom Lyon (photographers) ; Collectif Gilbard (production & curation)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/instagram.com\/gilbard.e.s","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012981"},"it":{"name":"Pauline Vanden Neste & Tom Lyon - SAS \/ Gilbard","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/instagram.com\/gilbard.e.s","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012981"},"cn":{"name":"Pauline Vanden Neste & Tom Lyon - SAS \/ Gilbard","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/instagram.com\/gilbard.e.s","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012981"},"fr":{"name":"Pauline Vanden Neste & Tom Lyon - SAS \/ Gilbard","shortdescr":"Du 6 septembre au 18 octobre, Gilbard accueille Pauline Vanden Neste et Tom Lyon dans le SAS pour \u201cZones\u201d. Travaillant sur la zone du canal depuis 2020, le duo de photographes belges en tire un portrait qui questionne sa r\u00e9appropriation et les enjeux li\u00e9s au partage de l\u2019espace public. ","longdescr":"\nDu 6 septembre au 18 octobre, Gilbard accueille Pauline Vanden Neste et Tom Lyon dans le SAS pour \u201cZones\u201d. Travaillant sur la zone du canal depuis 2020, le duo de photographes belges en tire un portrait qui questionne sa r\u00e9appropriation et les enjeux li\u00e9s au partage de l\u2019espace public. Pour l\u2019occasion, iels proposent une exposition qui prend le SAS comme point central et dont le parcours se d\u00e9roule dans les rues adjacentes. \n\nL\u2019exposition est accessible gratuitement et sans r\u00e9servation les vendredis de 13h30 \u00e0 18h, pendant les horaires de permanence de Gilbard. \n\u00c9galement accessible sur rendez-vous le reste de la semaine. Vous voulez organiser une visite guid\u00e9e avec un groupe ? \u00c9crivez-nous sur prog@gilbard.be\nVernissage le vendredi 06\/09\/2024, de 15h00 \u00e0 19h, en pr\u00e9sence des artistes. \n","performers":"Pauline Vanden Neste & Tom Lyon (photographes) ; Collectif Gilbard (production & curation)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/instagram.com\/gilbard.e.s","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012981"},"sp":{"name":"Pauline Vanden Neste & Tom Lyon - SAS \/ Gilbard","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/instagram.com\/gilbard.e.s","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012981"},"nl":{"name":"Pauline Vanden Neste & Tom Lyon - SAS \/ Gilbard","shortdescr":"Van 6 september tot 18 oktober verwelkomt Gilbard Pauline Vanden Neste en Tom Lyon in het SAS voor \u201cZones\u201d. Het Belgische fotografenduo, dat sinds 2020 aan de kanaalzone werkt, heeft een portret gecre\u00eberd dat de herbestemming en de problematiek van het delen van de openbare ruimte in vraag stelt.","longdescr":"Van 6 september tot 18 oktober verwelkomt Gilbard Pauline Vanden Neste en Tom Lyon in het SAS voor \u201cZones\u201d. Het Belgische fotografenduo, dat sinds 2020 aan de kanaalzone werkt, heeft een portret gecre\u00eberd dat de herbestemming en de problematiek van het delen van de openbare ruimte in vraag stelt. Voor de gelegenheid organiseren ze een tentoonstelling die het SAS als centraal punt heeft en waarvan de route zich ontvouwt in de aangrenzende straten.\n\n\nDe tentoonstelling is gratis en zonder reservering te bezoeken op vrijdag van 13.30 tot 18.00 uur, tijdens de kantooruren van Gilbard.\nDe rest van de week is de tentoonstelling op afspraak geopend. Wil je een rondleiding organiseren voor een groep? Neem dan contact met ons op via prog@gilbard.be\n","performers":"Pauline Vanden Neste & Tom Lyon (fotografen) ; Collectif Gilbard (curatoren en productie)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/instagram.com\/gilbard.e.s","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012981"}},"place":{"id":50001053,"t