urs","it":"Visite guidate","cn":null,"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","sp":"Visitas guiadas","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen"}},"others":{"list":[108],"translations":{"de":["Folklore"],"pt":[null],"en":["Folklore"],"it":["Folklore"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Folklore"],"sp":["Folclore"],"nl":["Folklore"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Bruegel et ses Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008885"},"pt":{"name":"Bruegel et ses Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008885"},"en":{"name":"Bruegel et ses Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Through this walking tour, discover the Marolles of the 16th century... and more specifically this emblematic character of our artistic culture : Bruegel.\nPierre Bruegel, who lived in Antwerp, fell in love with the daughter of his master Pieter Coecke van Aelst. To allow the marriage, her future mother-in-law put the condition to see the couple live in Brussels. Some months after their engagement, it is in the church\nNotre-Dame de la Chapelle in the Marolles that their union is made offi cial. Witness of a troubled political and religious period, Bruegel is contemporary with Charles V, his successor Philip the Second, the Duke D\u2019Albe, and will witness the execution of the\nCounts of Egmont and Hornes.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008885"},"it":{"name":"Bruegel et ses Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008885"},"cn":{"name":"Bruegel et ses Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008885"},"fr":{"name":"Bruegel et ses Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Au  travers d\u2019un itin\u00e9raire p\u00e9destre, d\u00e9couvrez les Marolles du XVI\u00e8 si\u00e8cle\u2026 et plus sp\u00e9cifiquement autour de ce personnage embl\u00e9matique de notre culture artistique : Bruegel\nPieter Bruegel, qui habite alors \u00e0 Anvers, tombe amoureux de la fille de son ma\u00eetre Pieter Coecke van Aelst. Pour autoriser le mariage, sa future belle-m\u00e8re met comme condition de voir le couple vivre \u00e0 Bruxelles. Quelque mois apr\u00e8s leurs fian\u00e7ailles, c\u2019est en l\u2019\u00e9glise Notre-Dame de la chapelle dans les Marolles que leur union est officielle. Les jeunes \u00e9poux s\u2019\u00e9tablissent dans ce quartier chic, appel\u00e9 aujourd\u2019hui le quartier Bruegel, et fr\u00e9quent\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque par l\u2019\u00e9lite et les artistes. T\u00e9moin d\u2019une p\u00e9riode trouble avec une situation politique et religieuse instable, Bruegel est contemporain de Charles Quint, de son fils successeur, du Duc D\u2019Albe et assistera \u00e0 l\u2019ex\u00e9cution des comtes d\u2019Egmont et Hornes. Il vivra \u00e0 Bruxelles jusqu\u2019\u00e0 sa mort en 1569 o\u00f9 il sera enseveli dans la m\u00eame \u00e9glise qui l\u2019avait sacr\u00e9 au mariage.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008885"},"sp":{"name":"Bruegel et ses Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008885"},"nl":{"name":"Bruegel et ses Marolles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Pieter Bruegel, die vervolgens in Antwerpen woont, wordt verliefd op de dochter van zijn meester Pieter Coecke van Aelst.\nOm het huwelijk mogelijk te maken, maakt haar toekomstige schoonmoeder het een voorwaarde om het paar in Brussel te zien wonen. Enkele maanden na hun verloving is het in de kerk Notre-Dame van de kapel in de Marollen officieel dat hun vakbond officieel is.\nBruegel is getuige van een turbulente periode met een onstabiele politieke en religieuze situatie en is hedendaags met Charles V, zijn opvolger, Duke D'Albe, en zal de uitvoering van de graven van Egmont en Hornes ondersteunen.\nHij zal in Brussel wonen tot zijn dood in 1569, wanneer hij zal worden begraven in dezelfde kerk die hem tot huwelijk had ingewijd.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008885"}},"place":{"id":244781,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Ascenseur des Marolles","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ep\u00e9e","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"100