il.5700001219"},"pt":{"name":"Gyrophare","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archipel19.be\/evenement\/gyrophare\/","email":"inscription@archipel19.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 469 26 75","phone_booking":"+32 2 469 26 75","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001219"},"en":{"name":"Gyrophare","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archipel19.be\/evenement\/gyrophare\/","email":"inscription@archipel19.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 469 26 75","phone_booking":"+32 2 469 26 75","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001219"},"it":{"name":"Gyrophare","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archipel19.be\/evenement\/gyrophare\/","email":"inscription@archipel19.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 469 26 75","phone_booking":"+32 2 469 26 75","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001219"},"cn":{"name":"Gyrophare","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archipel19.be\/evenement\/gyrophare\/","email":"inscription@archipel19.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 469 26 75","phone_booking":"+32 2 469 26 75","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001219"},"fr":{"name":"Gyrophare","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"CONCERT PUNK POUR LES ENFANTS\n\nN\u00e9 en 2012, Gyrophare se d\u00e9finit comme un groupe de \u201cpunk familial\u201d. \u00c0 l\u2019origine, il y a un r\u00e9el d\u00e9sir de proposer \u00e0 un jeune public des concerts de musique amplifi\u00e9e afin de l\u2019inviter \u00e0 partager un r\u00e9pertoire de chansons dr\u00f4les, \u00e9nergiques et fortement inspir\u00e9es par l\u2019imaginaire d\u00e9cal\u00e9 et po\u00e9tique de l\u2019enfance. C\u2019est au regard de cet univers fantaisiste, voire subversif, que nous qualifions notre style musical de \u201cpunk familial\u201d. Il s\u2019adresse aussi bien aux enfants qu\u2019\u00e0 leurs parents qui pourront y retrouver des allusions aux musiques populaires actuelles.\n\nCOMPOSITION\n\u2023 Eric Chagnon (guitare & choeurs)\n\u2023 Jonathan Van Iseghem (banjo & choeurs)\n\u2023 Benjamin Lecouls (contrebasse & chant)\n\u2023 Pierre Delcourt (guitare & choeurs)\n\u2023 Yann Renand (chant et ukul\u00e9l\u00e9)\n\u2023 Jean-Luc Millot et Gilles Boka (batterie & choeurs)\n\u2023 Cl\u00e9ment Thiry (clavier & chant)\n\nConcert gratuit organis\u00e9 dans le cadre de la F\u00eate de la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archipel19.be\/evenement\/gyrophare\/","email":"inscription@archipel19.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 469 26 75","phone_booking":"+32 2 469 26 75","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001219"},"sp":{"name":"Gyrophare","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archipel19.be\/evenement\/gyrophare\/","email":"inscription@archipel19.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 469 26 75","phone_booking":"+32 2 469 26 75","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001219"},"nl":{"name":"Gyrophare","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/archipel19.be\/evenement\/gyrophare\/","email":"inscription@archipel19.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 469 26 75","phone_booking":"+32 2 469 26 75","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001219"}},"place":{"id":236778,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Archipel 19 Centre culturel Berchem-Sainte-Agathe et Koekelberg. ","address_street_name":"Place de l'Eglise","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@archipel19.be","website":"http:\/\/www.archipel19.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 469 26 75","phone_booking":null,"