tic and decolonial storytelling walk","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/famefestival.be","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000582"},"pt":{"name":"Horizon 2060 \u00b7  Futuristic and decolonial storytelling walk","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/famefestival.be","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000582"},"en":{"name":"Horizon 2060 \u00b7  Futuristic and decolonial storytelling walk","shortdescr":"I See You\" reinvents the future of black and afro-descendant women through an immersive experience combining culture, art and prospective thinking.","longdescr":"I See You (ISY) is a cultural and artistic association for action and prospective thinking dedicated to Afro-descendants, and more specifically to afro-descendant women. We offer an immersive experience combining art, culture and forward thinking. We redefine the representation of black and afro-descendant women, encourage their contribution to society and foster a sustainable vision of our collective future.\n\nDiscover everyday Brussels in 2060 through the vision of black and afro-descendant women and the eyes of community.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/famefestival.be","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000582"},"it":{"name":"Horizon 2060 \u00b7  Futuristic and decolonial storytelling walk","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/famefestival.be","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000582"},"cn":{"name":"Horizon 2060 \u00b7  Futuristic and decolonial storytelling walk","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/famefestival.be","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000582"},"fr":{"name":"Horizon 2060 \u00b7  Balade cont\u00e9e futuriste et d\u00e9coloniale","shortdescr":"\"I See You\" r\u00e9invente l'avenir des femmes noires et afrodescendantes \u00e0 travers une exp\u00e9rience immersive alliant culture, art et r\u00e9flexion prospective.","longdescr":"Venez d\u00e9couvrir notre balade o\u00f9 chaque arr\u00eat r\u00e9v\u00e8le des r\u00e9cits puissants sur les d\u00e9fis et les succ\u00e8s des femmes noires et afrodescendantes. Nous explorerons les relations humaines en connexion avec le b\u00e2ti et la nature \u00e0 travers des pratiques durables et respectueuses de nos environnements. Cette exp\u00e9rience vise \u00e9galement \u00e0 d\u00e9construire les narratives dominantes pour promouvoir une compr\u00e9hension authentique des exp\u00e9riences des femmes issues des marges.\n\nRejoignez-nous pour cette aventure enrichissante et transformative, projet\u00e9e \u00e0 l'horizon 2060, \u00e0 travers la vision des femmes noires, afrodescendantes, et le regard de la collectivit\u00e9.","performers":"Aez Pinay","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/famefestival.be","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000582"},"sp":{"name":"Horizon 2060 \u00b7  Futuristic and decolonial storytelling walk","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/famefestival.be","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000582"},"nl":{"name":"Horizon 2060 \u00b7  Futuristische en dekoloniaal verhalenwandeling","shortdescr":"I See You vindt de toekomst van zwarte vrouwen en vrouwen met Afrikaanse afkomst opnieuw uit door middel van een meeslepende ervaring die cultuur, kunst en toekomstdenken verenigt","longdescr":"I See You (ISY) is een vereniging voor culturele en artistieke actie en toekomstdenken gewijd aan Afrikaanse afkomsten, en meer specifiek aan vrouwen. Wij bieden een meeslepende ervaring die kunst, cultuur en toekomstdenken verenigt. We herdefini\u00ebren de representatie van zwarte en vrouwen met Afrikaanse afkomst, moedigen hun bijdrage aan de samenleving aan en stimuleren een duurzame visie op onze collectieve toekomst.\n\nOntdek de dagelijkse omgeving van Brussel in 2060 door de visie van zwarte vrouwen, vrouwen met Afrikaanse afkomst en de ogen van de gemeenschap.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/famefestival.be","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000582"}},"place":{"id":279041,"translations":{"de":{"name":"FAME Festival","address_street_name":"Rue des Riches Claires","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"ticket@famefestival.be","website":"http:\/\/www.famefestival.be","phone_contact":"+32 456 29 70 73","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Riches Claires, 24","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"FAME Festival","address_street_name":"Rue des Riches Claires","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"ticket@famefestival.be","website":"http:\/\/www.famefestival.be","phone_contact":"+32 456 29 70 73","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":