ctive to extroverted, from high-flying to deeply rooted, but always searching for melodic and harmonic beauty. This is a beautiful trip, in mutual respect, complicity, lyricism, and sometimes with a hint of mystery.\u201d Michel Herr pianist, composer, arranger ","performers":"Charles Loos piano, composition, Jeanfran\u00e7ois Prins guitar, composition, S\u00e9bastien Walnier cello\n\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013321"},"it":{"name":"Loos\/Prins\/Walnier \"Avant un R\u00eave\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013321"},"cn":{"name":"Loos\/Prins\/Walnier \"Avant un R\u00eave\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013321"},"fr":{"name":"Loos\/Prins\/Walnier \"Avant un R\u00eave\"","shortdescr":"Trois excellents musiciens belges issus de la sc\u00e8ne jazz et classique forment cette constellation unique de \"jazz de chambre\" (piano, guitare et violoncelle), pour nous offrir un r\u00e9pertoire original rempli de m\u00e9lodies \u00e9mouvantes, de paysages sonores envo\u00fbtants et d'improvisations interactives et hautement dynamiques. ","longdescr":" \"...voyageant de l'introspection \u00e0 l'extraversion, de la haute voltige \u00e0 l'enracinement, mais toujours \u00e0 la recherche de la beaut\u00e9 m\u00e9lodique et harmonique. C'est un beau voyage, dans le respect mutuel, la complicit\u00e9, le lyrisme, avec parfois une pointe de myst\u00e8re.\" Michel Herr pianiste, compositeur, arrangeur ","performers":"Charles Loos piano, composition, Jeanfran\u00e7ois Prins guitar, composition, S\u00e9bastien Walnier cello\n\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013321"},"sp":{"name":"Loos\/Prins\/Walnier \"Avant un R\u00eave\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013321"},"nl":{"name":"Loos\/Prins\/Walnier \"Avant un R\u00eave\"","shortdescr":"Drie Belgische topmuzikanten uit zowel de jazz als de klassieke scene vormen deze unieke \"kamerjazz\" constellatie (piano, gitaar en cello), om ons een origineel repertoire te bieden vol hartveroverende melodie\u00ebn, meeslepende soundscapes en interactieve en zeer dynamische improvisaties.","longdescr":" \"...reizen van introspectief naar extravert, van hoogvliegend naar diepgeworteld, maar altijd op zoek naar melodische en harmonische schoonheid. Dit is een prachtige reis, in wederzijds respect, medeplichtigheid, lyriek, en soms met een vleugje mysterie.\" Michel Herr pianist, componist, arrangeur ","performers":"Charles Loos piano, composition, Jeanfran\u00e7ois Prins guitar, composition, S\u00e9bastien Walnier cello\n\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013321"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue 