o","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[6,4],"translations":{"de":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, Rock, Jazz..."],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"it":["Worldmusic, Folk e Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"sp":["Worldmusic, folk y country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"],"nl":["Worldmusic, Folk & Country","Pop, rock, jazz\u2026"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Kurdophone & Kourosh Ghazvineh","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20240928_kurdophone\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001060"},"pt":{"name":"Kurdophone & Kourosh Ghazvineh","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20240928_kurdophone\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001060"},"en":{"name":"Kurdophone & Kourosh Ghazvineh","shortdescr":"A Kurdish Night","longdescr":"Kourosh Ghazvineh :\n\nHailing from Sahneh in Iran\u2019s Kermanshah province, Kourosh Ghazvineh began his journey with the Persian santur at a young age. He later delved into the classical Kurdish-Persian makam for the tanbur, a long-necked lute, propelling him into an international career. As a resident composer at Radio Kermanshah, Ghazvineh not only penned a book on tanbur music but also taught at the \u201cLabyrinth Music Workshops\u201d in Crete (Houdetsi) and Rhodes (2017). His passion for music is evident not just in his performances and teachings but also in his dedicated support for the victims of the devastating 2017 Kermanshah earthquake.\n\n\nKurdophone :\n\nContemporary Explorations of Kurdish-Iranian Music\nKurdophone\u2019s compositions are both inspiring and emotionally resonant, blending musical sophistication with heartfelt expression. This Austrian-based quintet merges the intricate elements of Kurdish-Iranian music with jazz-rock influences and combines Arabic-Turkish maqams with classical music. Featuring Sarvin Hazin on kamancheh and violin, Amir Ahmadi on piano, H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Gl\u00fcxam on double bass, and Amir Wahba on percussion, the group\u2014founded by singer and tanbur player Omid Darvish\u2014creates a unique fusion at the intersection of Iranian folk music, Kurdish melodies, and contemporary classics. Their brilliant performance at Babel Music XP 2024 in Marseille made a lasting impression","performers":"Kourosh Ghazvineh : Tanbur, Santur, Vocals\n\nKurdophone :\nOmid Darvish: Vocals, Tanbur\nSarvin Hazin: Kamancheh, Violin\nAmir Ahmadi: Piano\nH\u00e9l\u00e8ne Gl\u00fcxam: Double Bass\nAmir Wahba: Percussion","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20240928_kurdophone\/?lang=en","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001060"},"it":{"name":"Kurdophone & Kourosh Ghazvineh","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20240928_kurdophone\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001060"},"cn":{"name":"Kurdophone & Kourosh Ghazvineh","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20240928_kurdophone\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001060"},"fr":{"name":"Kurdophone & Kourosh Ghazvineh","shortdescr":"La nuit de la musique Kurde","longdescr":"Kourosh Ghazvineh: \n\nOriginaire de Sahneh, dans la province iranienne de Kermanshah, Kourosh Ghazvineh a commenc\u00e9 \u00e0 apprendre le santour perse d\u00e8s son plus jeune \u00e2ge. Il a ensuite \u00e9tudi\u00e9 le makam classique kurdo-perse pour le tanbur (luth \u00e0 long manche), ce qui l\u2019a conduit vers une carri\u00e8re internationale.\n\nEn tant que compositeur r\u00e9sident \u00e0 Radio Kermanshah, il a \u00e9crit un livre de musique pour le tanbur et a enseign\u00e9 aux \u00ab Labyrinth Music Workshops \u00bb en Cr\u00e8te (Houdetsi) et \u00e0 Rhodes (2017). Il exprime sa passion pour la musique non seulement \u00e0 travers ses concerts, mais aussi par ses enseignements et son engagement solidaire envers les victimes du grave tremblement de terre de Kermanshah en 2017.\n\n\nKurdophone : \n\nLes envol\u00e9es contemporaines des musiques kurdo-iraniennes\n\nInspir\u00e9es et \u00e9mouvantes, les compositions de Kurdophone touchent autant \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9motion qu\u2019\u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9rudition musicale. Ce quintet bas\u00e9 en Autriche fusionne les raffinements des r\u00e9pertoires kurdo-iraniens avec le jazz-rock et les maqams arabo-turcs avec la musique classique.\n\nAvec Sarvin Hazin au kam\u00e2nche et violon, Amir Ahmadi au piano, H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Gl\u00fcxam \u00e0 la basse et Amir Wahba aux percussions, le groupe, fond\u00e9 par le chanteur-tanburiste Omid Darvish, trace un sillon in\u00e9dit au confluent de la musique folk iranienne, des m\u00e9lodies kurdes et des classiques contemporains. Savant et brillant, ce groupe a fait une grande impression \u00e0 Babel Music XP 2024, la rencontre des musiques du monde \u00e0 Marseille.","performers":"Kourosh Ghazvineh : Tanbur, Santur, Chant\n\nKurdophone: \nOmid Darvish : Chant, Tanbur\nSarvin Hazin : Kam\u00e2nche, Violon\nAmir Ahmadi : Piano\nH\u00e9l\u00e8ne Gl\u00fcxam : Contrebasse\nAmir Wahba : Percussions","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20240928_kurdophone\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001060"},"sp":{"name":"Kurdophone & Kourosh Ghazvineh","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20240928_kurdophone\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001060"},"nl":{"name":"Kurdophone & Kourosh Ghazvineh","shortdescr":"A Kurdish Night","longdescr":"Kourosh Ghazvineh :\n\nAfkomstig uit Sahneh in de provincie Kermanshah in Iran, begon Kourosh Ghazvineh op jonge leeftijd met het leren van de Perzische santur. Later verdiepte hij zich in de klassieke Koerdisch-Perzische makam voor de tanbur, een luit met lange hals, wat hem naar een internationale carri\u00e8re leidde. Als componist bij Radio Kermanshah schreef Ghazvineh niet alleen een boek over tanbur-muziek, maar gaf hij ook les tijdens de \u201cLabyrinth Music Workshops\u201d in Kreta (Houdetsi) en op Rhodos (2017). Zijn passie voor muziek komt niet alleen tot uiting in zijn optredens en lessen, maar ook in zijn toegewijde steun aan de slachtoffers van de verwoestende aardbeving in Kermanshah in 2017.\n\n\nKurdophone : \n\nDe composities van Kurdophone zijn zowel inspirerend als emotioneel resonant, met een combinatie van muzikale verfijning en oprechte expressie. Dit in Oostenrijk gevestigde kwintet mengt de ingewikkelde elementen van Koerdisch-Iraanse muziek met jazzrock-invloeden en combineert Arabisch-Turks maqam met klassieke muziek. Met Sarvin Hazin op kamancheh en viool, Amir Ahmadi op piano, H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Gl\u00fcxam op contrabas en Amir Wahba op percussie, cre\u00ebert de groep\u2014opgericht door zanger en tanburspeler Omid Darvish\u2014aangeven een unieke fusie op het snijpunt van Iraanse volksmuziek, Koerdische melodie\u00ebn en hedendaagse klassiekers. Hun briljante optreden op Babel Music XP 2024 in Marseille heeft een blijvende indruk achtergelaten.","performers":"Kourosh Ghazvineh : Tanbur, Santur, Zang\n\nKurdophone : \nOmid Darvish: Zang, Tanbur\nSarvin Hazin: Kamancheh, Viool\nAmir Ahmadi: Piano\nH\u00e9l\u00e8ne Gl\u00fcxam: Contrabas\nAmir Wahba: Percussie","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/concerts\/20240928_kurdophone\/?lang=nl","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001060"}},"place":{"id":230487,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Marni","address_street_name":"Rue de Vergnies","address_street_number":"25","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatremarni.com","website":"http:\/\/www.theatremarni.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 639 09 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 639 09 82","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de Vergnies, 25","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Marni","address_street_name":"Rue de Vergnies","address_street_number":"25","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatremarni.com","website":"http:\/\/www.theatremarni.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 639 09 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 639 09 82","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de Vergnies, 25","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Marni","address_street_name":"Rue de Vergnies","address_street_number":"25","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatremarni.com","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrem