"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","sp":"Visitas guiadas","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Guided Tour of the Former Grand Hospice - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000968"},"pt":{"name":"Guided Tour of the Former Grand Hospice - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000968"},"en":{"name":"Guided Tour of the Former Grand Hospice - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"The Grand Hospice was built by the architect Henri Partoes between 1824 and 1827 on the site of the former Grand B\u00e9guinage convent. Meant to house paupers and the sick, the building is laid out around two identical courtyards lined with arcades that recall cloisters. After completing the Hospice, Partoes devoted himself to redesigning the surroundings and created an important urban ensemble where symmetry and order reign.\n\nThe visits are accessible to wheelchair users.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000968"},"it":{"name":"Guided Tour of the Former Grand Hospice - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000968"},"cn":{"name":"Guided Tour of the Former Grand Hospice - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000968"},"fr":{"name":"Visite Guid\u00e9e de l'Ancien Grand Hospice - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Le Grand Hospice fut \u00e9difi\u00e9 par l'architecte Henri Partoes entre 1824 et 1827 sur le terrain de l'ancien Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles. Destin\u00e9 \u00e0 accueillir indigents et malades, ce b\u00e2timent s'articule autour de deux cours identiques bord\u00e9es d'arcades selon la typologie des clo\u00eetres. Apr\u00e8s cette premi\u00e8re r\u00e9alisation, Partoes, s'attachant \u00e0 repenser les abords du Grand Hospice, imagina un ensemble urbanistique significatif o\u00f9 r\u00e8gnent sym\u00e9trie et ordonnancement. \n\nCes visites sont accessibles aux personnes en fauteuil roulant.\n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000968"},"sp":{"name":"Guided Tour of the Former Grand Hospice - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000968"},"nl":{"name":"Rondleiding van het Voormalig Groot Godshuis - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Het Groot Godshuis werd tussen 1824 en 1827 door architect Henri Partoes gebouwd op het terrein van het voormalige Groot Begijnhof van Brussel. Dit gebouw, dat armen en zieken moest opvangen, ligt rond twee identieke, met arcaden omzoomde binnenpleinen, volgens een plan dat aan kloostergangen doet denken. Na dit eerste project nam Partoes ook de omgeving van het Groot Godshuis onder handen. Hij ontwierp een hele wijk waarin symmetrie en orde de boventoon voeren. \n\nDe bezoeken zijn toegankelijk voor rolstoelgebruikers.\n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000968"}},"place":{"id":276966,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Grand Hospice ist eine Mischung aus Pop-up-Bar, trendigem Hotspot und urbaner Oase - einer der neuen, Allrounder, die die Stadt noch lebendiger machen. Die G\u00e4rten des ehemaligen Institut Pacheco, ein neoklassizistischer Geb\u00e4udekomplex mit sch\u00f6nen Kolonnaden und einem denkmalgesch\u00fctzten Innengarten, sind zu einem beliebten Treffpunkt und Schauplatz zahlreicher kultureller Aktivit\u00e4ten geworden. Plaudern Sie bei einem Drink, spielen Sie P\u00e9tanque mit Freunden, entspannen Sie beim Yoga oder genie\u00dfen Sie eine kleine Auszeit in dem sch\u00f6nen Garten, wo im Sommer die Blumen bl\u00fchen und im Winter Lampion- und Lichterketten leuchten.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"A mix of the \"pop-up bar and lanterns\" spirit, a trendy bar and an urban oasis, the Grand Hospice is one of those new hybrid places that we really love and that make the city more vibrant. The gardens of the former Pacheco Institute, a neoclassical complex with beautiful colonnades and a listed interior park, have become a meeting point for a wide range of social and cultural activities. Chat while having a drink, play p\u00e9tanque with friends, take a relaxing yoga class or enjoy a healthy break in the countryside, this garden, which is in bloom in the summer and decorated with festive lights in winter, is a must-go!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Entre l\u2019esprit \u00ab guinguette et lampions \u00bb, le bar branch\u00e9 et l\u2019oasis urbaine, le Grand Hospice fait partie de ces nouveaux lieux hybrides que l\u2019on aime tant et qui font bouger la ville. Les jardins de l\u2019ancien Institut Pacheco, ensemble n\u00e9oclassique compos\u00e9 de belles colonnades et d\u2019un parc int\u00e9rieur class\u00e9, sont devenus un point de rencontre o\u00f9 activit\u00e9s sociales et culturelles se multiplient \u00e0 l\u2019envie. Pour papoter autour d\u2019un verre, jouer \u00e0 la p\u00e9tanque entre amis, prendre un cours de yoga \u00ab super chill \u00bb ou profiter d\u2019une pause salutaire au vert, ce jardin fleuri aux beaux jours et par\u00e9 de lumi\u00e8res festives en hiver est un must-go !","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Een sfeervol met lampionnen verlicht buitencaf\u00e9 met een trendy bar in een groene stadsoase? Dat is het Grand Hospice, een van de nieuwe, bruisende hybride plekjes waar we graag vertoeven. De tuinen van het voormalige Pacheco-Instituut, een neoclassicistisch geheel met prachtige zuilengangen en een als erfgoed geklasseerd binnenpark, zijn omgetoverd tot een ontmoetingsplek waar plaats is voor tal van sociale en culturele activiteiten. Of je nu met vrienden wilt bijpraten met een glaasje erbij, petanque wilt spelen, een 'superchill' yogales volgen of gewoon even tot rust wilt komen in het groen: alles kan in deze prachtige bloementuin, die in de winter feestelijk verlicht wordt!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":36966,"