cr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-bach-only-bach?id_evenement=6361","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000516"},"pt":{"name":"Concerts Escapades : Bach Only Bach","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-bach-only-bach?id_evenement=6361","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000516"},"en":{"name":"Concerts Escapades : Bach Only Bach","shortdescr":"Within the little world of classical guitar, Artyom Dervoed is one of the biggest names. In the slightly bigger world of the cello Shadrin is a new star, known in Belgium because of being part of the winners of the Queen Elisabeth Competition. In the concert they devote themselves to the one and only composer coming from outer-space : JS BACH","longdescr":"The new season of Concerts Escapades 2024-2025 kicks off on Sunday 29\/09 with a host of great and brilliant artists. From the Far East to the West, via the cosmos, we'll be setting the bar high. J.S. Bach opens the ball and Sakamoto closes it with electro-pop sounds. Between these great names in classical music, female voices will have the greatest share. \n- First concert, Sunday September 29 at 6:00 pm: BACH ONLY BACH, classical guitar concert\nArtyom Dervoed on guitar and Aleksey Shadrin on cello.\nWithin the little world of classical guitar, Artyom Dervoed is one of the biggest names. In the slightly bigger world of the cello Shadrin is a new star, known in Belgium because of being part of the winners of the Queen Elisabeth Competition. In the concert they devote themselves to the one and only composer coming from outer-space : JS BACH","performers":"Artyom Dervoed - Guitar et Aleksey Shadrin - Cello.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/ancien-site\/en-149\/activities\/?lang=en","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000516"},"it":{"name":"Concerts Escapades : Bach Only Bach","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-bach-only-bach?id_evenement=6361","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000516"},"cn":{"name":"Concerts Escapades : Bach Only Bach","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-bach-only-bach?id_evenement=6361","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000516"},"fr":{"name":"Concerts Escapades : Bach Only Bach","shortdescr":"Dans le petit monde de la guitare classique, Artyom Dervoed est l'un des plus grands noms. Et dans celui un peu plus vaste du violoncelle, Aleksey Shadrin est un nom en devenir, connu en Belgique puisqu'il a \u00e9t\u00e9 l'un des laur\u00e9ats du Concours Reine Elisabeth 2022. Dans ce concert, ils se consacrent \u00e0 l'\u0153uvre du seul compositeur venu du cosmos, l'OVNI de la musique : JS BACH. ","longdescr":"La nouvelle saison des Concerts Escapades 2024-2025 d\u00e9marre le Dimanche 29\/09 avec une pl\u00e9iade de grands et brillants artistes. De l'Extr\u00eame-Orient \u00e0 l'Occident, en passant par le cosmos, nous mettrons la barre haute. J.S. Bach ouvre le bal et Sakamoto le cl\u00f4t avec des sons \u00e9lectro-pop. Entre ces grands noms de la musique classique, la voie des femmes ainsi que leurs voix seront mises \u00e0 l'honneur. \n- Premier concert, le dimanche 29 septembre \u00e0 18h00 : BACH ONLY BACH, concert de guitare classique\nArtyom Dervoed \u00e0 la Guitare et Aleksey Shadrin au Violoncelle. Dans le petit monde de la guitare classique, Artyom Dervoed est l'un des plus grands noms. Et dans celui un peu plus vaste du violoncelle, Aleksey Shadrin est un nom en devenir, connu en Belgique puisqu'il a \u00e9t\u00e9 l'un des laur\u00e9ats du Concours Reine Elisabeth 2022.\nDans ce concert, ils se consacrent \u00e0 l'\u0153uvre du seul compositeur venu du cosmos, l'OVNI de la musique : JS BACH. ","performers":"Artyom Dervoed - Guitare et Aleksey Shadrin - Violoncelle.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-bach-only-bach?id_evenement=6361","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000516"},"sp":{"name":"Concerts Escapades : Bach Only Bach","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-bach-only-bach?id_evenement=6361","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000516"},"nl":{"name":"Concerts Escapades : Bach Only Bach","shortdescr":"In de kleine wereld van de klassieke gitaar is Artyom Dervoed een van de grootste namen. In de iets grotere wereld van de cello is Aleksey Shadrin een opkomende naam, bekend in Belgi\u00eb sinds hij een van de winnaars was van de Koningin Elisabethwedstrijd van 2022. In dit concert wijden ze zich aan het werk van de enige componist die uit de ruimte kwam : JS BACH. ","longdescr":"Het nieuwe seizoen Concerts Escapades 2024-2025 begint op zondag 29\/09 met een reeks verbazingwekkende en briljante artiesten. Van het Verre Oosten tot het Westen, via de kosmos, leggen we de lat heel hoog. J.S. Bach opent het bal en Sakamoto sluit het af met elektro-pop geluiden. Tussen deze grote namen in de klassieke muziek staan vrouwenstemmen in de schijnwerpers. \n- Eerste concert, zondag 29 september om 18 uur: BACH ONLY BACH, concert klassieke gitaar\n Artyom Dervoed op gitaar en Aleksey Shadrin op cello. \nIn de kleine wereld van de klassieke gitaar is Artyom Dervoed een van de grootste namen. In de iets grotere wereld van de cello is Aleksey Shadrin een opkomende naam, bekend in Belgi\u00eb sinds hij een van de winnaars was van de Koningin Elisabethwedstrijd van 2022. In dit concert wijden ze zich aan het werk van de enige componist die uit de ruimte kwam : JS BACH. ","performers":"Artyom Dervoed - Gitaar et Aleksey Shadrin - Cello.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/ancien-site\/nl-150\/activiteiten\/?lang=nl","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000516"}},"place":{"id":252101,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Link factory","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is above all a civil, cultural, sustainable and innovative project. Their cultural programme featuring performances, shows, exhibitions and so on goes hand in hand with a \u201ccivil\u201d programme of debates, conferences, inter-generational workshops, philosophical caf\u00e9 etc ... The place can be rented for events and there are plenty of really great parties! ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie est un projet culturel fond\u00e9 en 2010 par une poign\u00e9e de citoyen\u00b7nes et situ\u00e9 dans une ancienne usine restaur\u00e9e avec des mat\u00e9riaux \u00e9cologiques. La Tricoterie propose une programmation culturelle tr\u00e8s diversifi\u00e9e et centr\u00e9e sur la rencontre entre les diff\u00e9rents publics et le m\u00e9lange des activit\u00e9s culturelles.\r\n\r\nPassez la porte et d\u00e9couvrez :\r\n- Des spectacles de th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de danse, de cirque...\r\n- Des concerts, des soir\u00e9es, des sc\u00e8nes ouvertes, des jam sessions, une chorale d'un soir...\r\n- Des ateliers z\u00e9ro d\u00e9chet, peinture, c\u00e9ramique, \u0153nologie, danse...\r\n- Des projections de films, conf\u00e9rences, d\u00e9bats...\r\n- Des couscous \"s\u00e9pharabes\", des soir\u00e9es jeux de soci\u00e9t\u00e9, des activit\u00e9s pour enfants...\r\n- Des march\u00e9s des cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7rices, des vide-dressings, des march\u00e9s de No\u00ebl durables...\r\n\r\nUn petit creux ? La Triciterie vous propose un brunch tous les dimanches et un concept \"live cooking\" tous les vendredis soirs. Tous les plats sont 100% artisanaux, et pr\u00e9par\u00e9s sur place par l'\u00e9quipe avec des ingr\u00e9dients bio, locaux et de saison.\r\n\r\nEnvie d'organiser votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement chez vous ? La Tricoterie met ses salles \u00e0 disposition pour tout type d'\u00e9v\u00e9nement priv\u00e9 ou professionnel et propose \u00e9galement un service traiteur, que ce soit dans ses murs ou \u00e0 l'ext\u00e9rieur. Rendez-vous sur www.tricoterie.be pour en savoir plus !\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Contactenfabriek","address_street_name":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat, 158","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"La Tricoterie is een project met een welomlijnde filosofie, die blijkt uit de zelfgekozen naam (van tricoter, breien) waarmee verwijst wordt naar het smeden van banden om de strijd tegen de ontrafeling van het sociale weefsel aan te gaan. Opgezet als een \u00abContacten Fabriek\u00bb en een ontmoetingsplaats waar verschillende disciplines en publieken elkaar ontmoeten. Naast een culturele programmering (concerten, voorstellingen, expos\u2026) en socioculturele activiteiten die sociale cohesie beogen (debatten, conferenties, intergenerationele ateliers, caf\u00e9-filo\u2026) staan de ruimtes ook open voor verhuur aan externe organisaties en bedrijven. Tal van superleuke feestjes vinden er plaats, alsook een wekelijkse biomarkt, een repaircaf\u00e9 en een alternatieve geschenkenmarkt om maar enkele van de activiteiten te noemen die de duurzame levensvisie van de plek weerspiegelen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"de":["Saint-Gilles Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"it":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"sp":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":14176,"location":{"lat":50.83028735,"lon":4.33675871},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-05-15T13:04:23+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:47:56+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":276119,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Music Projects for Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue Albert Vanderkinderestraat","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mpfb.org","website":"www.mpfb.org","phone_contact":"+32 496 10 68 29","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Albert Vanderkinderestraat, 24","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Music Projects for Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue Albert Vanderkinderestraat","address_street_number":"24","address_st