ngdescr":"Originally referred to as the Palace of the Prince of Orange, this edifice and its stables were built during the Dutch period, between 1823 and 1828, by the Belgian architect Charles Vander Straeten (1771-1834). The palace was destined for Prince William II of Orange in recognition of his valiant conduct during the Battle of Waterloo. The architect Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys (1783-1861) supervised the end of the works after Charles Vander Straeten was removed from office. The Palace has seen various uses and transformations over time. Today it houses the Royal Academy of Science, Letters and Fine Arts of Belgium, among others. \n\nThe visits are accessible to wheelchair users.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/en\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000965"},"it":{"name":"Guided Tour of the Academy Paleis - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000965"},"cn":{"name":"Guided Tour of the Academy Paleis - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000965"},"fr":{"name":"Visite Guid\u00e9e du Palais des Acad\u00e9mies - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Originellement d\u00e9nomm\u00e9 \"Palais du Prince d'Orange\", cet \u00e9difice et ses \u00e9curies furent r\u00e9alis\u00e9s pendant la p\u00e9riode hollandaise, entre 1823 et 1828, par l'architecte belge Charles Vander Straeten (1771-1834). Le palais \u00e9tait destin\u00e9 au prince Guillaume II d'Orange, en reconnaissance de sa vaillante conduite durant la bataille de Waterloo. L'architecte Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys (1783-1861) supervisa l'ach\u00e8vement des travaux apr\u00e8s que Charles Vander Straeten fut destitu\u00e9 de ses fonctions. Par la suite, ce palais connut diff\u00e9rentes affectations et transformations successives. Il accueille aujourd'hui, entre autres, l'Acad\u00e9mie royale des sciences, des lettres et des beaux-arts de Belgique. \n\nCes visites sont accessibles aux personnes en fauteuil roulant.\n\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000965"},"sp":{"name":"Guided Tour of the Academy Paleis - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/fr\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000965"},"nl":{"name":"Rondleiding van het Academi\u00ebnpaleis - BBN 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Het Paleis der Academi\u00ebn stond oorspronkelijk bekend als het Paleis van de Prins van Oranje. Het gebouw en de stallen werden tijdens het Hollands bewind, tussen 1823 en 1828, opgetrokken onder leiding van de Belgische architect Charles Vander Straeten (1771-1834). Ze waren bestemd voor kroonprins Willem II van Oranje, als eerbetoon voor zijn heldhaftige gedrag tijdens de Slag bij Waterloo. Nadat Charles Van der Straeten uit zijn functie ontheven werd, volgde architect Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys (1783-1861) de voltooiing van de werken op. Nadien onderging het paleis nog tal van transformaties en kende het verschillende bestemmingen. Het is nu onder meer de thuisbasis van de Koninklijke Academie voor Wetenschappen, Letteren en Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb. \n\nDe bezoeken zijn toegankelijk voor rolstoelgebruikers.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.explore.brussels\/nl\/bbn","email":"info@explore.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 50 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 319 50 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000965"}},"place":{"id":262301,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Acad\u00e9mie Royale - Palais des Acad\u00e9mies, Salle Progogine","address_street_name":"Rue Ducale","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ducale, 1","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Acad\u00e9mie Royale - Palais des Acad\u00e9mies, Salle Progogine","address_street_name":"Rue Ducale","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ducale, 1","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Acad\u00e9mie Royale - Palais des Acad\u00e9mies, Salle Progogine","address_street_name":"Rue Ducale","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Ducale, 1","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"i