r from the forest is a special experience. You tune in to other senses. You discover silence, but you also notice movements and sounds that are absent during the day. Moreover, when you walk during the most intense and important moments of the lunar cycle, you can transform your intentions. That is what these walks invite you to do.\n\nWe will walk in silence, interspersed with some experiments to which An invites you. Each walk takes a maximum of 2 hours. We conclude with a cup of tea.\n\nMore information: https:\/\/moonwalks.be","performers":"The walks are an initiative of Ana\u00efs Berck, represented here by the thousands of trees of the Sonian forest and by artist, storyteller and nature guide An Mertens.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/","email":"anais@anaisberck.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000451"},"it":{"name":"Maanwandeling","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/index_fr.html","email":"anais@anaisberck.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000451"},"cn":{"name":"Maanwandeling","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/index_fr.html","email":"anais@anaisberck.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000451"},"fr":{"name":"Balades lunaires","shortdescr":"Balade m\u00e9ditative \u00e0 la For\u00eat de Soignes lors de Nouvelle et Pleine Lune","longdescr":"Se promener lorsque toutes les couleurs disparaissent de la for\u00eat est une exp\u00e9rience particuli\u00e8re. Vous \u00eates \u00e0 l'\u00e9coute d\u2019autres sens. Vous d\u00e9couvrez le silence, mais vous remarquez aussi des mouvements et des sons qui sont absents pendant la journ\u00e9e. De plus, lorsque vous marchez pendant les moments les plus intenses et les plus importants du cycle lunaire, vous pouvez transformer vos intentions. C'est \u00e0 cela que vous invitent ces marches.\n\nNous marcherons en silence, entrecoup\u00e9s de quelques exp\u00e9riences auxquelles An vous invite. Chaque promenade dure au maximum 2 heures. Nous terminons en partageant un th\u00e9.\n\nPlus d'informations: https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/index_fr.html","performers":"Les balades sont une initiative d'Ana\u00efs Berck, repr\u00e9sent\u00e9e ici par les milliers d'arbres de la for\u00eat de Soignes et par l'artiste, conteuse et guide nature An Mertens.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/index_fr.html","email":"anais@anaisberck.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000451"},"sp":{"name":"Maanwandeling","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/index_fr.html","email":"anais@anaisberck.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000451"},"nl":{"name":"Maanwandelingen","shortdescr":"Meditatieve en transformatieve wandeling in het Zoni\u00ebnwoud bij Nieuwe en Volle Maan","longdescr":"Wandelen wanneer alle kleurtjes uit het Zoni\u00ebnwoud verdwijnen, is een bijzondere ervaring. Je stelt in op andere zintuigen. Je ontdekt de stilte, maar je merkt ook bewegingen en geluiden op die overdag afwezig zijn. Wanneer je bovendien wandelt tijdens de meest intense en belangrijke momenten van de maancyclus, kan je je intenties transformeren. Dat is waartoe deze wandelingen je uitnodigen.\n\nWe wandelen in stilte, afgewisseld met enkele experimenten waartoe An je uitnodigt. Elke wandeling duurt maximum 2 uur. We sluiten af met een kopje thee.","performers":"De wandelingen zijn een initiatief van Ana\u00efs Berck, hier vertegenwoordigd door de duizenden bomen van het Zoni\u00ebnwoud en door kunstenaar, verteller en natuurgids An Mertens.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/index_nl.html","email":"anais@anaisberck.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000451"}},"place":{"id":277026,"translations":{"de":{"name":"For\u00eat de Soignes - Porte d'acc\u00e8s Hippodrome de Boitsfort","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de la Hulpe","address_street_number":"53","address_street_box":"A","email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de la Hulpe, 53 \/ A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"For\u00eat de Soignes - Porte d'acc\u00e8s Hippodrome de Boitsfort","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de la Hulpe","address_street_number":"53","address_street_box":"A","email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de la Hulpe, 53 \/ A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Sonian Forest - Gateway Hippodrome de Boitsfort","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de la Hulpe","address_street_number":"53","address_street_box":"A","email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de la Hulpe, 53 \/ A","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"For\u00eat de Soignes - Porte d'acc\u00e8s Hippodrome de Boitsfort","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de l