ull,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000466"},"en":{"name":"Edible Forest","shortdescr":"On this walk, you will discover all kinds of goodies found in nature, just along a path, in a tree or by a bush. From the smallest plants to the biggest trees, there are many beings in the forest ready to share edible and drinkable parts of their body. The Sonian Forest is a protected area, so picking is out of the question. But abundance all the more!","longdescr":"A walk lasts 2 hours and costs 20\u20ac.\nWe meet at the parking lot of Enfants Noy\u00e9s\/Verdronken Kinderen, in Dr\u00e8ve du Comte\/Graafdreef in Boisfort\/Bosvoorde: https:\/\/www.openstreetmap.org\/way\/14502214#map=17\/50.79518\/4.40096.\nPlease register in advance at anais@anaisberck.be.","performers":"An Mertens is a nature guide and artist. She has previously organised walks around Edible Forest for GC Wabo.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/projects\/edible-forest.html","email":"anais@anaisberck.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000466"},"it":{"name":"Edible Forest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/projects\/edible-forest_fr.html","email":"anais@anaisberck.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000466"},"cn":{"name":"Edible Forest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/projects\/edible-forest_fr.html","email":"anais@anaisberck.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000466"},"fr":{"name":"For\u00eat Comestible","shortdescr":"Vous d\u00e9couvrirez toutes sortes de bonnes choses que l'on trouve dans la nature, au d\u00e9tour d'un chemin, d'un arbre ou d'un buisson. Des plus petites plantes aux plus grands arbres, il y a une abondance d'\u00eatres vivants dans la for\u00eat qui sont pr\u00eats \u00e0 partager du comestible et buvable. La for\u00eat de Soignes est une zone prot\u00e9g\u00e9e, la cueillette est donc exclue.\nMais l'abondance n'en est que plus grande !","longdescr":"La promenade dure 2 heures et co\u00fbte 20 \u20ac.\nNous nous retrouvons sur le parking de Enfants Noy\u00e9s\/Verdronken Kinderen, \u00e0 la Dr\u00e8ve du Comte\/Graafdreef \u00e0 Boitsfort\/Bosvoorde : https:\/\/www.openstreetmap.org\/way\/14502214#map=17\/50.79518\/4.40096.\nVeuillez vous inscrire \u00e0 l'avance sur anais@anaisberck.be.","performers":"An Mertens est guide nature et artiste. Elle a d\u00e9j\u00e0 organis\u00e9 des promenades autour de la for\u00eat comestible pour GC Wabo.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/projects\/edible-forest_fr.html","email":"anais@anaisberck.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000466"},"sp":{"name":"Edible Forest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/moonwalks.be\/projects\/edible-forest_fr.html","email":"anais@anaisberck.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000466"},"nl":{"name":"Eetbaar Bos","shortdescr":"Tijdens deze wandeling ontdek je allerlei lekkers dat in de natuur te vinden is, zomaar langs een pad, in een boom of bij een struik. Van de kleinste planten tot de grootste bomen, er is van alles te vinden in het bos dat eet- en drinkbaar is. Het Zoni\u00ebnwoud is beschermd gebied, daarom is plukken er niet bij.\nMaar overvloed des te meer!","longdescr":"Een wandeling duurt 2 uur en kost 20\u20ac.\nWe spreken af op de parking van Verdronken Kinderen, in de Graafdreef in Bosvoorde: https:\/\/www.openstreetmap.org\/way\/14502